OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm project recommended for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a solar farm on agricultural
OL,7,Fland in North Yorkshire have been
OL,8,Frecommended for approval despite
OL,9,Fconcerns from residents about the loss
OL,10,Fof productive farmland.
OL,12,FAmpyr Solar Europe is seeking
OL,13,Fpermission to build and operate a
OL,14,F49.9MW solar farm on 235 acres (75 ha)
OL,15,Fland at Brownmoor Lane, south-west of
OL,16,FSutton-on-the-Forest.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
