OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm project recommended for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development would include
OL,7,Fground-mounted solar panels up to three
OL,8,Fmetres high (10ft), a 10MW battery
OL,9,Fenergy storage system, a new
OL,10,Fsubstation, access tracks, fencing and
OL,11,FCCTV.
OL,13,FNorth Yorkshire Council's strategic
OL,14,Fplanning committee are due to consider
OL,15,Fthe application on 13 October, with
OL,16,Fplanning officers recommending
OL,17,Fpermission is granted.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
